    - target: {fileID: 4448929236478944982, guid: 33e6f6977b777bb4c8f6761d58ca9903, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Twain looks in the mirror. \r\n \r\nIt\u2019s new and cheap, like all
        the other ones which have been installed in regular intervals across the
        barracks.They are nothing special. Serviceable. \r\n\r\nHe gives himself
        a good look. His uniform is not impeccable, but it is still within regulations.
        black eyes with bags under them, the consequence of one too many nights poring
        over books. Joining the Clubs, the Order\u2019s research division, has been
        his goal for so long that now that he\u2019s accomplished it he feels a bit
        lost.\r\n\r\nTwain moves his hand up to adjust his lapel and his reflection
        follows, after which he passes a thin comb through black locks and tames
        the worst of his bed hair.\r\n\r\nServiceable, for a first day. He hopes
        it will be enough. \r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4448929236478944982, guid: 33e6f6977b777bb4c8f6761d58ca9903, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSizeBase
      value: 18
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4448929236478944982, guid: 33e6f6977b777bb4c8f6761d58ca9903, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontColor32.rgba
